    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SALE OF MAGNIFICIENT THREE BEDROOM DETACHED BUNGALOW AND GARDENS IN CENTRAL LOCATION  \r\n\r\nSuperbly located just off The Sea Road, a beautifully maintained modern three-bedroom detached home situated in a most sought-after private quality residential development and comes to the market in excellent condition throughout offering a quiet friendly neighbourhood just off the Sea Road.\r\n\r\nThe Pines is a very select development of detached bungalows located off The Sea Road in Arklow town a few minutes’ walk to North beach, swimming pool, leisure centre, Arklow Bay Hotel, shops, schools, churches, Bridgewater Shopping Centre, Arklow’s Main Street Shopping and all town amenities and facilities, and a short drive to the North exit of Arklow bypass.\r\n\r\nThis lovely home has three large bedrooms (Main En-Suite), great size lounge with solid fuel stove, magnificent kitchen-dining room, family bathroom, and enclosed private rear garden and patio, off street parking nicely situated as you enter the development. The property was constructed to high standards, insulated cavity walls, with red brick front, new double-glazed uPVC windows, maintenance free, gutters and exterior.\r\n\r\nA truly magnificent house in great location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ENTRANCE PORCH \r\n1.24m x 0.51m\r\nTiled floor, double glazed door.\r\n\r\nENTRANCE HALL \r\n7.70m x 1.24m\r\nLaminate flooring with airing cupboard and storage cupboard off.\r\n\r\nKITCHEN / DINING ROOM \r\n4.89m / 4.05m\r\nEco interiors German made Kitchen, Silestone Calacatta Gold Worktop, fully integrated larder, fridge, freezer and dishwasher. \r\n•\tElica aspirating induction hob \r\n•\tQuooker boiling tap \r\n•\tInSinkErator waste disposal unit\r\n\r\nLovely bright kitchen, beautiful floor tiling, recessed lighting. Door to garden. \r\n\r\nLIVING ROOM \r\n5.34m x 4.05m\r\nA fine spacious room located to the front of the bungalow with large front window, laminate flooring, with features multi solid fuel stove and mantle.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 1 (Master Bedroom) \r\n3.95m x 3.13m\r\nA bright spacious Room with fitted wardrobes, laminate flooring.\r\n\r\nEn- Suite \r\n2.2m x 1.27m\r\nShower cubicle, fully tiled walls and floor, power shower and vanity unit, electric towel rail, whb, under floor heating. \r\n \r\nBEDROOM 2 \r\n3.05m x 3.38m  \r\nFitted wardrobe, laminated floor, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBEDROOM 3   \r\n2.05m x 3.28m\r\nLaminate floor, T.V. point.\r\n\r\nBATHROOM \r\n3.18m x 1.90m  \r\nComprising bath with shower attachment over bath, floating sink unit, wc, part tiled walls, under floor heating.\r\n\r\nExcellent usable attic space 4.92m x 4.02m \r\nLaminate flooring, built in alcove, shelved, three led lighting. Three Velux windows.\r\n\r\nExcellent location, short stroll to schools, shops, supermarkets, commuter bus and all town amenities. Numerous sporting activities, bars, restaurants, and all Arklow town services and amenities. Short walk to beach and shops.\r\n\r\nServices: Mains electricity, water and sewage. Oil fired radiator type central heating. \r\n\r\nNEGOTIATOR: PETER MILLS PROPERTY\r\n19 Lower Main Street, Arklow, Co. Wicklow V14 V6P0\r\n\r\nTel: 0402 32911\r\n\r\ninfo@petermillsproperty.com"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "A lovely spacious 3 bed detached bungalow c. 118.16 m2 (c. 1272 ft2).\r\n\r\nSpacious detached property in an extremely sought-after residential area of town\r\n  \r\nEnclosed private mature rear garden\r\n\r\nSmall garden shed with electric laid on, fully insulated which houses the washer and dryer\r\n\r\nModern design home and Low maintenance exterior\r\n\r\nOff street parking\r\n\r\nPedestrian side access to rear sunny garden with patio area where you can sit and enjoy summer days\r\n\r\nA few minutes’ drive from Exit 21 (Arklow South) onto M11 motorway. Less than an hour’s drive to Dublin\r\n\r\nuPVC windows and doors\r\n\r\nFibre optic broadband and cctv"
